	quest.1F5E5AF1FC4C6B0A.quest_desc: [
		"&fMekanism Is A &eTech Mod &fThat Adds &eMachines, Energy Generation &fand &eCrafting &fto Minecraft."
		""
		"学习如何&e处理&f资源，&f建造复杂装置。开始探索&eMekanism，&f将你的体验提升到新高度！"
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"&fThe &eHeat Generator &fProduces &cRF Energy &ffrom Heat Sources. Place it Next To &6Lava &fto Generate Power Over Time or throw &0Coal &ffor &eAcceleration &fin it. "
	]
