	quest.4771A36F01AB37DC.title: "&e扩展分子组装器"
	quest.47CA4A725E520A1D.quest_desc: [
		"一种取代传统&e合成CPU&f的&e高级多区块结构&f。"
		""
		"只要有足够的&eCrafting Storage&f，它就能同时运行&eCrafting Tasks&f，数量&eUnlimited Amount&f。"
		""
